Z||000000||Gokart||10-30-1999||06:06 AM||||I can hear the bendex going on my starter so I better not wait too long to replace it. Is it a fairly easy job that a carpenters son like myself can handle. I got tools and lots of spirit when it comes to working on my GT!<p>[This message has been edited by Gokart (edited 10-30-1999).]||||reg||5
